WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.754
The ice breathes.

00:02.454 --> 00:05.170
The bright colours are sea frozen over.

00:05.620 --> 00:14.802
Each winter the ice around the north pole grows until it covers more than the whole of Europe, and each summer about two thirds of it melts again.

00:15.252 --> 00:20.405
The summer ice has shrunk by more than a third since satellites began to watch it.
